      "thumbnailUrl": "https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/90070251/medium.jpeg",
      "distinction": "Among its pinkgill relatives, salmon pinkgill stands out for its consistently bright orange color - the yellow unicorn entoloma is more yellow, while the aborted entoloma often appears as irregular white blobs."
    },
    {
      "slug": "entoloma-murrayi",
